      "author_association": "MEMBER",
      "body": "Do you think there is any real benefit to even supporting HEAD? It might make sense for a webserver but I think we can justify not implementing it at all. I think the METHOD NOT ALLOWED response from the RPC server is correct and in fact, we should probably add a similar check limiting the REST server only to GET requests.",
